Grab your favorite flavor of @Greek yogurt{6%oz} and add it to a #bowl{}.

Top with @granola{1/4%cup}, @fresh fruit{1%cup}, and a drizzle of @honey{1-2%tsp} or @?maple syrup{}.

Feel free to mix and match types of fruit and add any optional extras your heart desires! Enjoy!

> Fruit options: bananas, blueberries, raspberries, strawberries, blackberries, peaches, mango, pineapple, kiwi

> Optional extras: chia seeds, hemp hearts, nut butter, shredded or flaked coconut, assorted seeds/nuts, mini chocolate chips, cinnamon